[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0010","text":"（好厉害……进到剩下３骑了……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0020","text":"（──但是……是三足鼎立吗……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0030","text":"不、不拼命乱闹一通的话\n感觉要输了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0040","text":"……呵呵\n要乱闹吗？拼命地"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0050","text":"剩下的人看起来都挺高的，\n要不要踮起脚尖～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0060","text":"呵呵\n再跳起来试试"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0070","text":"啊哈～！\n来了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0080","text":"要上了哦……\n３、２、１──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0090","text":"呵呵……大家一起跳起来……\n结果却散架了，真是的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0100","text":"冠军什么的，不拿也没关系\n────要是这么说的话，会被骂吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0110","text":"……他说“赢了就能看到”────\n到底看到了什么呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0120","text":"那种话\n只是说得像那么回事而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0130","text":"────♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0140","text":"好吵，干什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0150","text":"风\n在呼唤"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0160","text":"────♪\n来了～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0170","text":"嗯\n还没"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0180","text":"────\n……呵呵，要是来了就好了呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0190","text":"不会来的\n────♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_99_0200","text":"————啊哈哈"}]
